<view class="page"><view class="label">六人掼蛋</view><view class="section-title">连接设置</view><view class="muted">同桌玩家需要连接同一个服务。</view><view class="field"><text>服务地址</text><input class="address" value="{{server}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="200" placeholder="https://game.example.com" /></view><view class="hint">开发工具可连接本机 http://127.0.0.1:3001；真机调试请填写电脑的局域网 IP。正式环境使用已配置合法域名的 HTTPS 服务，实时连接使用 WSS。</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="message" wx:if="{{message}}">{{message}}</view><view class="button-row"><button class="secondary" bindtap="test" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">测试当前连接</button><button class="primary" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy}}">保存地址</button></view><view class="footer">身份和房间记录按服务地址分别保存</view></view>